"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마한테","audio":"/audio/8fb1fd20c5354a4695d7.mp3"}},{"text":"묻니?","meaning":"问","explanation":"묻다：问；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69471","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻니","audio":"/audio/b2ad62e2353c49074a02.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아봐.","meaning":"取回，找回；试，试图","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아봐","audio":"/audio/7aa9fdd2fd285b82650e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"问","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"69471","definition":"要求回答或说明。","pronunciation":["묻ː따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","e